            output:``'none'`` | ``'mean'`` | ``'sum'``. ``'none'``: no reduction
            will be applied, ``'mean'``: the output is the average of all batch
            member losses, ``'sum'``: the output is the sum of all batch member
            losses. Default: ``'mean'``.

